OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court accused of   
OL,4,Arape in Kelvingrove Park               
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court accused of 
OL,7,Fraping a woman to the danger of her    
OL,8,Flife in Glasgow's Kelvingrove Park.    
OL,10,FThomas Bell, 37, allegedly assaulted   
OL,11,Fthe 22-year-old woman on 20 November.  
OL,13,FBell made no plea at a private hearing 
OL,14,Fat Glasgow Sheriff Court and will      
OL,15,Fappear again within the next eight     
OL,16,Fdays.                                  
OL,18,FPolice taped off parts of the park     
OL,19,Fafter being called to the scene with   
OL,20,Fextra patrols taking place around the  
OL,21,Farea.                                  
